{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53415","headline":"法堂 · 白元鉴","name":"法堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高踪遗可继，虚室即流尘。\n越国曾封邑，蓬莱早会真。\n余风生户牖，残影照江滨。\n化鹤年犹远，空悲云水亲。\n（影印本《诗渊》第三册第一五六九页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白元鉴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}